  <h2>A university of discovery.<br>A future built through experience.</h2>
  <p>Established in 1986, Jordan University of Science and Technology is a public university near Irbid in northern Jordan. Its teaching and research bring together scientific knowledge, technology and professional practice.</p><p>JUST prepares graduates to contribute to Jordan and the wider region. This internship platform extends that purpose beyond the classroom, helping students explore opportunities and gain practical experience.</p>
  <p>Discover training opportunities, apply through your university account, and follow your progress throughout the internship journey.</p><a class="university-source" href="https://www.just.edu.jo/aboutjust/Pages/Highlights.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discover more about JUST <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
