   <li><b>1</b><span><strong>Discover</strong> internship announcements from partner organisations.</span></li>
   <li><b>2</b><span><strong>Apply</strong> through your account before each deadline.</span></li>
   <li><b>3</b><span><strong>Manage</strong> your training from start to finish.</span></li>
  </ul>
  </div>
</section>

